Description: R wrappers around the cubature C library of Steven
    G. Johnson for adaptive multivariate integration over hypercubes
    and the Cuba C library of Thomas Hahn for deterministic and
    Monte Carlo integration. A unified interface is provided via
    `cubintegrate`, and both scalar and vector interfaces are
    available for cubature and Cuba routines; the vector interfaces
    are recommended for performance-sensitive work, as demonstrated
    in the vectorization vignette. An optional robust error
    estimator is available for non-smooth integrands.
